# image-size@1.2.1 (transitive dep of pptxgenjs, slides/pptx/) — DoS via an
# infinite loop in the ICNS/JXL/HEIF parsers. No fixed image-size release
# exists yet (both advisories cover every version up to and including the
# latest, 2.0.2). Accepted: this tool runs only at build time, regenerating
# our own decks from locally-authored SVG/PNG — it never parses ICNS, JXL, or
# HEIF, and never touches attacker-controlled or networked input.
# https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-w3rx-r6r6-pgpr
# https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-5p2g-fcmc-qvqq
CVE-2025-71329
